\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par Praise to the Lord, The Almighty,\cf0 
\par the King of creation;
\par praise God, my soul, for in him,
\par are your health and salvation;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par come all who hear,
\par into his presence draw near
\par  joining in glad adoration.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl200\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Praise to the Lord, who in all things
\par \pard\li270\sl200\slmult0 is wondrously reigning,
\par shields you from harm and is gently
\par yet firmly sustaining.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Have you not seen,
\par how your heart's wishes have been 
\par granted be God's wise ordaining?
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Praise to the Lord, who with blessing
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and power will defend you;
\par surely his goodness and mercy shall
\par daily attend you;
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par ponder anew
\par what the Almighty can do:
\par God will forever befriend you.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Praise to the Lord! O let all that is
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 in me adore Him!
\par All that has life and breath, come now
\par with praises before Him!
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Let the Amen
\par sound from God's people again:
\par \pard    gladly forever adore him.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

